abstract: >-
  Reproducible Python analysis code for cohort construction, descriptive
  analysis, repeated nested cross-validation, performance evaluation,
  interpretation, ablation, and sensitivity analyses for five-year breast
  cancer recurrence prediction using routinely collected clinical data.
